l&quot; control for Skill B.\n    5. Click it; confirm the &quot;Remove skill?&quot; dialog; Skill B is removed\n       from the UI list while Skill A remains.\n    6. Confirm persistence via a full page reload (detach auto-saves via\n       API; no explicit agent-level Save is available for this action).\n    7. Reopen the Agent (same reload satisfies this — no separate\n       close/reopen gesture exists in the live flow); only Skill A is\n       attached.\n    8. Navigate directly to Skill B's detail page and to the Skills list;\n       Skill B still exists standalone (detached, not deleted).\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"_verify_url","time":{"start":1787268332470,"stop":1787268332470,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"delete_output_dir","time":{"start":1787268332470,"stop":1787268332470,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"base_url","time":{"start":1787268332470,"stop":1787268332470,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"pytestconfig","time":{"start":1787268332470,"stop":1787268332470,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"browser","time":{"start":1787268332471,"stop":1787268332929,"duration":458},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachme